 ['Russian authorities: dead and injured from Ukrainian strikes in occupied Luhansk, Bryansk and Belgorod regions and occupied Donetsk; drone near a clinic in Enerhodar', 'Occupied Luhansk, Bryansk and Belgorod regions, occupied Donetsk, Enerhodar',
